<headline>FINAL PRICING - Northwestern University, Ill..</headline>
<text>
<p>ILLINOIS EDUCATIONAL FACILITIES AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $20,000,000</p>
<p>REVENUE REFUNDING BONDS</p>
<p>NORTHWESTERN UNIVERSITY, SERIES 1996</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aa1		   S&amp;P: AA</p>
